[h1]More Tenets Slots (XA) — CK3 1.20.0.4[/h1]
Expand your rite's core tenet slots to 100, with scrollable grids in rite creation and faith interfaces. Cultural tradition limits follow the base game.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Up to 100 core tenet slots using the game's native tenet definitions, eligibility, conflicts, costs and DLC requirements.
[*]Scrollable tenet grids in rite creation and both faith detail layouts, projected from the CK3 1.20.0.4 interfaces, including ordinary doctrine selector bindings.
[*]No bundled 10000 culture tradition limit. Normal cultural tradition limits and bonuses apply; extra tradition mods are optional and separate.
[*]Internal selector metadata updates are excluded from rite-update handling. Real tenet and doctrine changes keep the game's normal notification behavior.
[/list]
A 100-slot limit does not guarantee 100 mutually compatible tenets.

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese and Spanish localization files are included. Non-Chinese languages receive format checks; live acceptance uses Simplified Chinese.

Simplified Chinese acceptance on CK3 1.20.0.4 covered ordinary doctrine candidates and replacement, core tenet replacement, selection of slot 100, sparse rite creation, normal cultural tradition limits, notification convergence and saving. An independent cold reload in a new game process verified the saved character, date and religious identity, retained all four real core tenets and the unique selections in the tested ordinary doctrine groups, and checked notifications again. After the finite creation notices cleared, no recurring rite-update notifications were observed in the recorded creation and cold-reload windows, each longer than 75 seconds.

Compatibility of saves already above the normal culture tradition limit and CK3 1.19 save migration remain unverified. Tests do not cover every tenet or DLC combination. The separate POD patches are not covered. Mods replacing the same faith or rite windows may need a compatibility patch.

[h2]中文说明[/h2]
为礼仪系统扩展至 [b]100 个核心信条槽位[/b]，创建窗口与信仰详情窗口均可滚动查看；文化传统上限使用游戏本身的规则。
[list]
[*]继承游戏原生信条定义，保留条件、互斥、费用及 DLC 限制；100 个槽位不代表有 100 个互不冲突的信条。
[*]按 CK3 1.20.0.4 原版重新投影礼仪和信仰窗口，包括普通教义选择器绑定。
[*]取消捆绑的 10000 文化传统上限，保留原版上限与正常增益；需要额外传统的玩家可另选独立传统 mod。
[*]仅内部选择器元数据变化不再进入礼仪更新处理；真实信条或教义变化仍保留原生通知行为。
[/list]
包含游戏支持的九种语言本地化；实机验收只用简体中文，其他语言仅做格式检查。

已在 CK3 1.20.0.4 使用简体中文验证普通教义候选与替换、核心信条替换、第 100 槽位选择、稀疏礼仪创建、原版文化传统上限、通知收敛及保存。独立新进程冷载核对了存档角色、日期和宗教身份，保留全部四个真实核心信条，受测普通教义组中的选择仍各自唯一，并再次检查了通知。有限的创建通知清理后，新建与冷载各自超过 75 秒的有界观察期间，均未见礼仪更新通知反复出现。

既有文化已超过原版传统上限的存档兼容性、1.19 旧存档迁移仍未验证；不保证全部信条或 DLC 组合。本次不包含独立 POD 补丁。同样覆盖信仰或礼仪窗口的其他 mod 可能需要兼容补丁。

